      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 1136926977,
          "type": null,
          "body": "We have several places that either #define REPL as 0x00FFFD or 0xFFFD or whatever or just directly use 0xFFFD.\n\nThat should probably be in a header file in wsutil.  Should it go into unicode-utils.h, some other existing header, or in some new header?",
